# Time to Kill workspace

Owned US SLUS-00583. Public tree is notes and jobs, not the disc.

- GitHub: MusicMonsterMod/duke-nukem-time-to-kill-recomp
- Use only MusicMonsterMod for git and GitHub on this repo
- Ignore and never add: dumps under `game/` (except `game/README.md`), `research/`, `recomp/`, `.venv/`, BIOS, memcards
- Vanilla remains available; Modernized is optional
- `$continue-duke-recomp` (Codex) or `/continue-duke-recomp` (Claude Code) shows `MODERNIZATION_JOBS.md` and waits; do not start work unasked
- Do not hand-edit generated C, overwrite original media, or use player memory cards
- Do not launch or disturb an active game session unless the user asks
- ASCII hyphen `-` only; no em dash (U+2014) or en dash (U+2013)
